.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">337</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, en Sicile ; <span class=\"grec\">ποιεῖσθαι τὴν δ.\nἐν τῷ ὕδατι, ἐν τῇ γῇ,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">H.A.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 1,</span>\nvivre dans l’eau, sur terre ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">4</span> lieu de passe-temps,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> école (<span class=\"ital\">cf.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">lat.</span> <span class=\"lat\">schŏla</span> =\n<span class=\"grec\">σχολή</span>), <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span> école de philosophie, <span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">211</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ; école <span class=\"ital\">en génér.</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Isocr.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">237</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ; <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Alc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">24,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span></div>\n</div>\n"}]}